sequenceDiagram
  participant Pipe as AuthorityPipelineStagesExecutor
  participant Stage as Context ingestion stage
  participant Ctx as ArchLucid.ContextIngestion
  participant SQL as Tenant SQL catalog
  Note over Pipe,Stage: OTel span authority.context_ingestion<br/>tag archlucid.stage.name

  Pipe->>Stage: Run stage (inline or queued)
  Stage->>Ctx: Normalize ArchitectureRequest + evidence
  Ctx->>SQL: Persist context snapshot / evidence refs
  Ctx-->>Stage: ContextSnapshotId
  Stage-->>Pipe: Stage complete → next authority.graph
